---
layout: default
---
{% comment %}
A landing page that fans out to a set of site sections, each rendered with
the same card component the Campaigns page uses for individual projects —
so a "section" here is just a hand-written stand-in for a portfolio
collection item (title, tagline, industry, summary, img, url).

  page.sections — array of {title, tagline, industry, summary, img, img_alt, url}
{% endcomment %}
<div class="call-out call-out_solid">
    <h1 class="call-out_title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
</div>

{% if page.subtitle %}
<p class="portfolio-index__subtitle">{{ page.subtitle }}</p>
{% endif %}

<section class="portfolio-group">
    <div class="portfolio-index">
        {% for s in page.sections %}
        {% include portfolio/card.liquid item=s %}
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
